sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Passenger
  participant API as Express API
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant S as Socket.IO
  participant D as Driver

  P->>API: POST /api/bookings
  API->>DB: Insert requested booking
  API->>S: broadcast booking_request
  S->>D: booking_request event
  D->>API: POST /api/bookings/:id/accept
  API->>DB: Assign driver and mark accepted
  API->>S: booking_accepted
  S->>P: booking_accepted event